#: scrnsave.cpp:359
msgid "Screen Saver"
msgstr "Screen Saver"

#: scrnsave.cpp:374
msgid ""
"This is a list of the available screen savers. Select the one you want to "
"use."
msgstr "Ovo je lista dostupnih screen saver-a. Izaberite onaj koji želite koristiti."

#: scrnsave.cpp:378
msgid "&Setup..."
msgstr "&Podesi..."

#: scrnsave.cpp:382
msgid ""
"If the screen saver you selected has customizable features, you can set them "
"up by clicking this button."
msgstr ""
"Ukoliko screen saver koji ste izabrali ima dodatne opcije, možete ih "
"podesiti tako što ćete kliknuti na ovo dugme."

#: scrnsave.cpp:385
msgid "&Test"
msgstr "&Testiraj"

#: scrnsave.cpp:389
msgid ""
"You can try out the screen saver by clicking this button. (Also, the preview "
"image shows you what the screen saver will look like.)"
msgstr ""
"Možete isprobati screen saver ako kliknete na ovo dugme. (Također, na "
"slici koja se nalazi desno možete vidjeti kako screen saver izgleda.)"

#: scrnsave.cpp:393
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Postavke"

#: scrnsave.cpp:400
#, fuzzy
msgid "Start a&utomatically"
msgstr "Pokreni screen saver a&utomatski"

#: scrnsave.cpp:403
msgid ""
"When you check this option, the selected screen saver will be started "
"automatically after a certain number of minutes of inactivity. This timeout "
"period can be set using the spinbox below."
msgstr ""
"Ako označite ovu opciju izabrani screen saver će biti pokrenut automatski "
"nakon određenog vremena neaktivnosti. Ovo vrijeme možete odrediti u "
"spinbox-u ispod."

#: scrnsave.cpp:414 scrnsave.cpp:453
msgid "After:"
msgstr "Nakon:"

#: scrnsave.cpp:420
msgid " minutes"
msgstr " minuta"

#: scrnsave.cpp:421
msgid "1 minute"
msgstr " 1 minuta"

#: scrnsave.cpp:430
msgid ""
"Choose the period of inactivity after which the screen saver should start. "
"To prevent the screen saver from automatically starting, uncheck the above "
"option."
msgstr ""
"Izaberite period neaktivnosti poslije kojeg će se screen saver pokrenuti. "
"Da bi spriječili automatsko pokretanje screen savera isključite gornju "
"opciju."

#: scrnsave.cpp:438
#, fuzzy
msgid "&Require password to stop"
msgstr "Zah&tjevaj šifru za zaustavljanje screen savera"

#: scrnsave.cpp:445
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If you check this option, the display will be locked after the screen saver "
"has been started. To restore the display, enter your account password at the "
"prompt. You can specify in the spinbox below a delay after which the display "
"will actually be locked."
msgstr ""
"Ako uključite ovu opciju, display će biti zaključan kada se screen saver "
"pokrene. Da se vratite nazad na display, ukucajte šifru vašeg accounta na "
"promptu."

#: scrnsave.cpp:456
msgid ""
"The period after which the display will be locked.To prevent the display "
"from being locked, disable the option above."
msgstr ""

#: scrnsave.cpp:463
msgid " seconds"
msgstr ""

#: scrnsave.cpp:464
msgid "1 second"
msgstr ""

#: scrnsave.cpp:482
msgid "Choose the period after which the display will be locked. "
msgstr ""

#: scrnsave.cpp:488
#, fuzzy
msgid "Make aware of power &management"
msgstr "Učini screen saver svjesnim uštede energije"

#: scrnsave.cpp:494
msgid ""
"Enable this option if you want to disable the screen saver while watching TV "
"or movies."
msgstr ""
"Uključite ovu opciju ako želite da isključite screen save dok gledate TV "
"ili filmove."

#: scrnsave.cpp:506
msgid "Here you can see a preview of the selected screen saver."
msgstr "Ovjde možete vidjeti kako screen saver koji ste izabrali izgleda."

#: scrnsave.cpp:511
msgid "Advanced &Options..."
msgstr ""

#: scrnsave.cpp:732
msgid "Loading..."
msgstr "Učitavam..."

#: scrnsave.cpp:1126
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<h1>Screen Saver</h1> This module allows you to enable and configure a "
"screen saver. Note that you can enable a screen saver even if you have power "
"saving features enabled for your display."
"<p> Besides providing an endless variety of entertainment and preventing "
"monitor burn-in, a screen saver also gives you a simple way to lock your "
"display if you are going to leave it unattended for a while. If you want the "
"screen saver to lock the session, make sure you enable the \"Require "
"password\" feature of the screen saver; if you do not, you can still "
"explicitly lock the session using the desktop's \"Lock Session\" action."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Screen saver</h1> Ovaj modul vam omogućava da uključite i podesite "
"zaštitu ekrana (screen saver). Primijetite da možete uključiti screen "
"saver čak i ako imate aktivirane postavke za uštedu energije na vašem "
"ekranu."
"<p>"
" Osim pružanja beskrajne raznovrsne zabave i spječavanja \"urezivanja\" "
"slike na vaš ekran, screen saver vam takođe daje i jednostavan način da "
"zaključate vaš ako ćete ga ostaviti bez nadzora za neko vrijeme. Ako "
"želite da screen saver zaključa vaš ekran, pobrinite se da aktivirate "
"opciju screen savera \"Zahtijevaj šifru\". Ako to ne uradite, možete i "
"dalje eksplicitno zaključati ekran koristeći akciju \"Zaključaj ekran\"."

